                            rdfs:comment "Numeric identifier of the system call invoked by the process, corresponding to the system call table of the operating system architecture."@en ;
                            rdfs:label "has syscall number"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto#hasTTY
amiseconto:hasTTY rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
